# Runtime Sessions

This directory records public-safe indexes for runtime activity.

Each session may record the goal, time, participating systems, input boundary, output location, key observations, and lesson pointers. Do not store private source text, secrets, tokens, customer material, or unauthorized transcript text.

Session outputs move to the relevant work/artifacts/docs surface; observations and lessons point to `runtime/runtime-lessons/`, then `evolution/ipo/` reviews them.
